    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1438">

                <pb facs="0942" n="826" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg826"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.52/394.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Vice Consul Silliman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 5, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Spanish Embassy reports Constitutionalists at San Luis Potosi are exacting loans
                    from Spanish residents there and are confiscating their cattle.</p>
                <p>Request Carranza to telegraph orders to local authorities at San Luis Potosi to
                    discontinue enforcing unjust loans and to return confiscated property to
                    rightful owners.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
